{"type":"message","id":"7c364880","parentId":"4dd29183","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:31:12.763Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me write a memory file for this task.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-5c05fc97aff344a18f7baa2d5cbe3780","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# 2026-03-04 Memory\n\n## Task: ParMETIS 优化方案设计\n\n### Workspace\n`/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter`\n\n### Summary\nCompleted design for three ParMETIS optimization problems in cgnsMeshCutter.\n\n### Design Decisions\n\n1. **P0-1: distribute() 负载不均衡**\n   - Root cause: Initial distribution unrelated to ParMETIS partition results\n   - Solution: Distribution-aware pre-alignment with partition hints\n   - Trade-off: Slightly increased complexity, major communication reduction\n\n2. **P0-2: Interface 通信效率低**\n   - Root cause: String serialization + full Allgather\n   - Solution: Binary serialization + sparse point-to-point communication\n   - Trade-off: Need to handle endianness (low risk for homogeneous clusters)\n\n3. **P1: 字符串匹配效率低**\n   - Root cause: Multiple string conversions and allocations\n   - Solution: Use P0-2 binary format directly, eliminates string overhead\n   - Trade-off: None significant, purely performance improvement\n\n### Key Files\n- `metisCutter.cpp` - Main optimization target\n- `metisCutter.h` - Data structure definitions\n- `stringUtil.cpp` - Current string splitting (to be bypassed)\n\n### Report Location\n`$HOME/.openclaw-reports/design-agent/parmetis-optimization-design.md`\n\n### Implementation Priority\n1. P0-2 + P1 (together, binary serialization)\n2. P0-1 (distribution alignment)\n\n### Status\n✅ Design Complete - Awaiting leader-agent coordination for code-agent implementation","file_path":"/home/one/.openclaw/agents/design-agent/workspace/memory/2026-03-04.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":29349,"output":403,"cacheRead":3327,"cache