{"type":"message","id":"486305f4","parentId":"3b6bba7a","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:31:30.221Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I've completed the design task. Let me summarize what was done.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"## Design Complete\n\n**Deliverable:** `$HOME/.openclaw-reports/design-agent/parmetis-optimization-design.md`\n\n### Summary\n\nAnalyzed `/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter` source code and designed optimization solutions for three identified problems:\n\n| Problem | Root Cause | Solution | Expected Improvement |\n|---------|-----------|----------|---------------------|\n| **P0-1** distribute() 负载不均衡 | Initial distribution unaligned with ParMETIS partition results | Distribution-aware pre-alignment | 50-90% communication reduction |\n| **P0-2** Interface 通信效率低 | String serialization + full Allgather | Binary format + sparse P2P | 80%+ CPU reduction |\n| **P1** 字符串匹配效率低 | Multiple string conversions | Direct binary parsing (via P0-2) | Eliminates string overhead |\n\n### Key Design Artifacts\n\n1. **Binary message format** with fixed header + variable body\n2. **InterfaceMessageBuilder/Parser** classes for zero-copy serialization\n3. **DistributionHint** structure for aligning initial distribution with partitions\n4. **Sparse communication pattern** replacing full Allgather\n\n### Implementation Priority\n\n1. **Phase 1**: P0-2 + P1 (binary serialization) - 2-3 days\n2. **Phase 2**: P0-1 (distribution alignment) - 3-5 days"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":514,"output":328,"cacheRead":32575,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":33417,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772620272769}}
